2307:**Cause:** Agent ran the first lifecycle commands, then exited before completing the actual work or reaching its role handoff status. Board state looks active even though execution stopped.
2309:**Fix:** Always cross-check: `task-board q 'agents()'` + `task-board spawn status RUN-...` + run events/log file modification times. If the process is dead but the task did not reach its producer handoff or reviewer verdict status, inspect run events and outcome resources, then retry or reroute with a focused child run. Use `blocked` only when the evidence proves an external blocker or unresolved human-only stop-the-line decision, and attach the full evidence packet plus the exact human decision or external input needed to resume. Never hand recoverable work to the human or leave a parked intermediate status as the final state.
